    "preamble": "Dhia Chebbi.pdf | Coordonnées\nwww.linkedin.com/in/dhia-chebbi\n(LinkedIn)\nPrincipales compétences\nElasticsearch\nmachine learning\nPython\nLanguages\nAnglais  (Professional Working)\nAllemand  (Elementary)\nFrançais  (Full Professional)",
    "certs": "What is Data Science ?\nFundamentals of Deep Learning for\nComputer Vision\nMachine Learning with Python\nLe Deep Learning de A à ZDhia Chebbi\nMachine Learning Engineer\nTunisia\nRésumé\nMultidisciplinary Engineer with excellent problem solving abilities and\nprocess-thinking skill seeks hands on experience within a company\nthat embraces creativity and innovation. Through my studies, I\nhave gained extensive knowledge of Software engineering, artificial\nintelligence, enthusiastic in machine learning, Data mining and\nubiquitous computing. Effective communicator who builds positive,\ncohesive relationship with all level of staff, eager to put my extensive\nstudies and knowledge to practical.\nExpérience\nInfor\nData Science Engineer\navril 2024 - Present  (1 an 11 mois)\nTunis, Tunisia\nDATAMOTOR\nMachine Learning Engineer\noctobre 2022 - mars 2024  (1 an 6 mois)\nTunis, Tunisia\nPython async , Flask , multithreading , web scrapping , elasticsearch , NLP ,\nPostgreSQL , time series, tensorflow , LLM , GPT-4 , pytest , docker , GCP .\nTarget Energy Solutions\nData Scientist\nmars 2021 - septembre 2022  (1 an 7 mois)\nTunis, Tunisia\n• Contributed on a Microsoft application named Text2task capable of creating\ntasks and events automatically from emails.\n• Constructed an NLP model capable of extracting dates with relative events.\n• Implemented a deep learning model to detect actions breakpoints\n(tasks),assignee,urgency from emails .\n• Created data pipelines capable of searching data with keywords from\ndifferent sources .\n  Page 1 of 3\n   \n• Extractd data from various dataset (csv.josn ..) and improved the data\nquality .\n• Prediction of oil well production based on time series model of recursive\nneural network .\n• Keywords : Python , Flask , RNN , web scrapping , docker , graphql , entity\nrecognition , data cleaning .\nTarget Energy Solutions\nData Scientist\njuillet 2020 - août 2020  (2 mois)\nTunis, Tunisie\nduring this internship i have closely worked as part of the data team on project\ntiteled \"workspace chatbot AI assistant\" , the main tasks carried out in this\ninternship are :\n- implementation of queries and mutations with graphQL for web services\n- study of possible scenarios\n- implementation of the proposed scenarios\n- integration of chatbot in a web server (webchat)\n- creation of a model for rasa NLU\n- generation of data with the creation of a python script to improve the model\n- creation of a model for rasa Core\n- test and improvement of models\n- presentation of the results\nWEVIOO\nDat"
  },
